// Program metadata for kitty.
//
// kind=user → installed by the profile runner inside the chroot as the owning
// user via paru, with temp NOPASSWD sudo for seeding /etc/skel and /root.
// Installs the FiraCode Nerd font (so kitty's font_family renders Nerd glyphs)
// and seeds the full kitty config (bundled under home/, kept byte-identical to
// the repo stow tree by a drift test) plus the Noctalia-generated theme default
// (Catppuccin Mocha Sapphire). The kitty package itself is owned by core
// packages.shell + the Noctalia preset, not here; the installer never stows
// (ADR 0095/0130), so the repo copy stays hand-stowable.

{
  "name": "kitty",
  "kind": "user",
  "description": "Kitty config seeded fleet-wide (Noctalia-following) + FiraCode Nerd font."
}
